Z||000006||bcwawright||05-15-2001||01:43 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by skitime:<BR><B>Thanks, I promise to take good care of the car.  What engine do you have that is producing 300HP.  I want one. I assume you have the five speed?  Do you have pictures of the engine on the cradle?<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>The motor is a 2.8 that was custom built by the guy I bought the car from....from what I gather it uses an IRM turbo kit and the turbo was modified by TEC...it has a Spearco intercooler and some sort of trick Jacobson Ignition system that is fixing to be upgraded to an Electromotive unit. The engine was balanced and blueprinted and uses forged pistons with 7.5 compression ratio. The injectors are RC Engineering and the intake is ported and polished and was bored for a larger throttle body. Car has a Separate waste gate that is cockpit adjustable(I use 15lbs of boost max so far). Exhaust valves were custom built sodium filled(whatever that means). Other than that I don't know all the other mods that were made.....I know this...no car has beat me yet<BR>The motor was built as I understand by a guy that used to build Buick GN 3.4 motors and was very familiar with Menard Racing's Indy car Buick engines. Sorry..no pictures I just got the car last week.<P>Bruce<P>||||reg||1
